{"unit_id":"vianvio__dsh-plugin-drop-path#card-zh","repo":"vianvio/dsh-plugin-drop-path","commit":"0ad0df155388c27580b005578efaa1960de5e5d2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-drop-path 是 DSH 的网页客户端插件：把一个文件夹拖到 DSH 输入框时，将该文件夹的本机绝对路径插入为文件夹引用块。它在输入框上方注册覆盖层，并在 window 捕获阶段处理恰好一个文件夹的拖放；普通文件和多选继续交给原有附件流程。插件通过桌面端文件路径桥取得路径，并使用会话引用插入事件保留草稿结构和光标。适合在 DSH Desktop 中把本机文件夹路径加入提示词；使用前需在 DSH Desktop 中安装启用插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:151-168","client.js:213-235","client.js:482-515","cordis.patch.yml:11-13"]}
{"unit_id":"vianvio__dsh-plugin-drop-path#card-en","repo":"vianvio/dsh-plugin-drop-path","commit":"0ad0df155388c27580b005578efaa1960de5e5d2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-drop-path lets DSH Desktop users drop one folder onto the composer and insert its local path as a folder reference. Ordinary files and multiple selections keep the existing attachment behavior. It uses the desktop path bridge and session reference event.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:151-168","client.js:213-235","client.js:482-515","cordis.patch.yml:11-13"]}
