{"unit_id":"vianvio__dsh-plugin-drop-path#feature-1","repo":"vianvio/dsh-plugin-drop-path","commit":"0ad0df155388c27580b005578efaa1960de5e5d2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-drop-path 的功能「拖入文件夹插入路径」：将恰好一个文件夹拖到 DSH 输入框时读取桌面端提供的绝对路径，并以文件夹引用块插入草稿；普通文件或多项拖放不接管。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:115-135","client.js:151-168","client.js:213-235"]}
